especially the older one...


01:23:20.914 --> 01:23:22.707
- And his son...
- Yes, I know.


01:23:25.710 --> 01:23:27.212
It won't happen again.


01:23:33.385 --> 01:23:34.970
You'll have to go
away on holiday.


01:23:35.595 --> 01:23:37.806
You can't work
looking like that.


01:23:46.064 --> 01:23:47.649
Where to?
Shall I arrange it?


01:23:52.195 --> 01:23:53.863
Go get some rest.


01:23:54.489 --> 01:23:55.949
My birthday party's tonight.


01:23:55.949 --> 01:23:58.159
Come tarted up!
Cook will pick you up.


01:24:01.204 --> 01:24:02.205
Come here.


01:24:02.372 --> 01:24:03.289
Come over here.


01:24:16.469 --> 01:24:17.721
I was very scared.


01:24:20.765 --> 01:24:21.975
Come here.


01:24:30.859 --> 01:24:32.193
I'm not a child anymore.


01:26:55.503 --> 01:26:56.880
Wow, you look terrible.


01:26:58.548 --> 01:26:59.632
Plus, you're late.


01:27:00.800 --> 01:27:02.051
You all right?


01:27:02.385 --> 01:27:03.595
I'm all right.


01:27:03.970 --> 01:27:05.138
My baby.


01:27:06.931 --> 01:27:08.850
Is Rupert your boyfriend now?


01:27:10.810 --> 01:27:11.853
No.


01:27:11.853 --> 01:27:13.563
Oh, come on,
you can tell me.


01:27:14.689 --> 01:27:15.732
I said no.


01:27:15.940 --> 01:27:17.483
You OK? You're being strange.


01:27:18.067 --> 01:27:19.027
I'm all right.


01:27:19.944 --> 01:27:21.112
I'll call you.


01:27:22.113 --> 01:27:25.742
Hold on. I know you.
I can see when things are wrong.


01:27:26.659 --> 01:27:28.119
No, you don't know me.


01:27:28.119 --> 01:27:29.204
What?


01:27:29.204 --> 01:27:30.205
You don't know me.


01:27:30.830 --> 01:27:32.832
I'm a whore.
Did you know that?


01:27:33.041 --> 01:27:34.626
He can't be my boyfriend.
I'm a whore.


01:27:51.226 --> 01:27:53.186
The hotel confirmed the info.


01:27:54.020 --> 01:27:55.688
The girls were with that bloke.


01:27:57.190 --> 01:28:00.235
I'll settle it with them
tonight. You handle him.


01:28:03.363 --> 01:28:05.073
- You OK?
- No.


01:28:10.078 --> 01:28:11.120
Later.


01:28:50.702 --> 01:28:52.328
Did you glam up for me?


01:28:53.288 --> 01:28:54.497
Thanks.


01:28:58.126 --> 01:29:00.336
Don't look so sullen.
Have fun. Mingle.


01:29:01.754 --> 01:29:04.007
We'll talk about
the guy at the hotel.


01:29:07.093 --> 01:29:08.052
Have fun.


01:30:50.196 --> 01:30:52.323
This is hardly a relaxing party.


01:30:53.116 --> 01:30:54.075
We're working.


01:30:55.451 --> 01:30:58.162
I can multitask.
You can, too, right?


01:31:01.207 --> 01:31:02.250
Who was the guy?


01:31:06.754 --> 01:31:08.005
My boyfriend...


01:31:08.965 --> 01:31:11.884
He's not in this business.
I panicked and called him.


01:31:13.094 --> 01:31:14.846
You should have called me.


01:31:15.888 --> 01:31:17.181
I was scared.


01:31:20.309 --> 01:31:21.144
You've got a boyfriend?


01:31:27.733 --> 01:31:29.777
Since when?
ls this recent?


01:31:33.072 --> 01:31:36.367
He's not really my boyfriend.
He's more like a friend.


01:31:42.123 --> 01:31:44.333
You've got no room
for a love life.


01:31:45.668 --> 01:31:46.878
I know.


01:31:47.128 --> 01:31:48.629
Especially a man like him.


01:31:48.838 --> 01:31:50.256
He's not a friend.


01:31:55.720 --> 01:31:56.929
What makes you happy?


01:31:58.598 --> 01:31:59.682
Me?


01:32:02.560 --> 01:32:03.728
Everything.


01:32:05.688 --> 01:32:07.690
Everything I own.
Everything I've earned.


01:32:11.277 --> 01:32:13.070
A nice life,
the ease of things.


01:32:22.538 --> 01:32:24.248
I've had a rough life, you know.


01:32:25.625 --> 01:32:27.418
Like you, I guess.


01:32:32.965 --> 01:32:34.759
If you work and don't screw up,


01:32:34.759 --> 01:32:36.719
you could have my job
in a few years.


01:32:39.388 --> 01:32:40.389
What do you think?


01:33:00.243 --> 01:33:01.744
What's that snide look?


01:33:03.955 --> 01:33:05.623
What's that snide look?


01:33:05.831 --> 01:33:07.833
You're pissing me off.
What is this?


01:33:10.795 --> 01:33:12.129
Are you judging me?


01:33:14.048 --> 01:33:15.800
You think you're superior?


01:33:17.843 --> 01:33:19.428
Or you're stronger maybe?


01:33:22.515 --> 01:33:24.267
Hey, Virginie,


01:33:24.934 --> 01:33:26.519
you'd be crap without me.


01:33:27.562 --> 01:33:28.646
You know that?


01:33:29.272 --> 01:33:32.650
All the money you made is thanks
to me. You realize that?


01:33:34.819 --> 01:33:35.903
Hey, little whore,


01:33:36.195 --> 01:33:37.738
lower your gaze now.


01:33:38.239 --> 01:33:39.198
Lower your gaze!


01:33:39.991 --> 01:33:41.951
Do as I say! Lower your gaze!


01:33:42.493 --> 01:33:43.744
Lower your gaze now!


01:33:44.036 --> 01:33:45.621
Do you hear me?


01:33:46.747 --> 01:33:47.665
Lower your gaze!


01:33:51.961 --> 01:33:53.212
Clobber her!


01:33:53.379 --> 01:33:54.922
Catch her and clobber her!


01:34:18.779 --> 01:34:19.905
What are you doing?


01:34:20.823 --> 01:34:22.116
I'm tired of running.


01:34:29.373 --> 01:34:30.916
Virginie, help me!


01:35:10.915 --> 01:35:11.916
Don't call me that.


01:35:25.554 --> 01:35:27.640
Your money is as filthy as mine.


01:37:21.212 --> 01:37:22.421
I'll miss you.


01:37:24.924 --> 01:37:26.008
I know you.


01:37:26.801 --> 01:37:27.760
For sure.


01:37:29.053 --> 01:37:30.429
I'll miss you, too.


01:37:31.597 --> 01:37:32.556
For sure.


01:37:34.892 --> 01:37:37.019
- Take care of her.
- Promise.


01:37:38.103 --> 01:37:39.814
I'll come fetch her soon.


01:38:06.423 --> 01:38:08.717
<i>Final call for check-in.</i>


01:39:39.266 --> 01:39:41.143
Aren't you tired
of rescuing whores?

